      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Ultra-Fast Google Search SERP API Grounding for n8n AI Agents\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nGive your n8n AI Agents live Google Search grounding with structured organic results, snippets, and related questions.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/google-search-results-fast-serp-api`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/google-search-results-fast-serp-api) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Google Search Results Fast SERP Scraper API** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
